  "description": "1-bed unit available at Newtown Gardens, located on Newtownpark Avenue, Blackrock. This near-new development, built by Glenveagh Developments and owned by Union, offers luxury rental accommodation in the prestigious and well-established residential area of Blackrock, Co. Dublin.\n\nKey Features:\n•\tExclusive Amenities: Residents will enjoy access to a communal kitchen area, co-working spaces, and a convenient MyPup parcel collection service.\n•\tPrime Location: Situated just minutes from Blackrock Village, the area is known for its vibrant atmosphere and stunning views of Dublin Bay. Blackrock and nearby Stillorgan villages provide residents with access to shopping, dining, and entertainment, with two major shopping centers—Blackrock Shopping Centre and Frascati Centre—offering a wide range of stores and services.\n\nProperty Specifications:\n•\tInterior Design: Each unit is finished with high-quality interiors and comes fully furnished with bespoke Hyde Interiors furniture packs.\n•\tModern Kitchen: Apartments feature integrated kitchens with all modern appliances.\n•\tLuxury Bathrooms: Both main and ensuite bathrooms are outfitted with luxurious fittings.\n•\tUtility Space: A separate utility room includes a washer/dryer and extra storage space.\n•\tOutdoor Space: Each apartment offers a spacious balcony for outdoor relaxation.\n•\tParking & Storage: The development includes underground and surface parking, as well as secure bicycle storage.\n•\tEnergy Efficiency: The units boast excellent energy ratings (A2-A3), ensuring energy savings and sustainability.\n\nTransport & Connectivity:\nNewtown Gardens is well-connected to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas via the DART and multiple bus routes, making commuting hassle-free.\n\n** Please note photos may differ slightly from units available **",
